"note": "Aggregated here from QC-pass samples. Mixed-genotype samples are counted as carrying the mutation. Samples with missing calls are excluded from that marker's denominator. Convenience samples, not designed prevalence surveys; no per-paper publication date, so treat the date as collection year and label the source as a data release.",
